{
  "bookId": "rewind-20",
  "id": "chapter-84",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22612001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "呜哇……好大的鬼轮，看、看起来好锋利！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "危险的气息……嗯……是让人看不透的多重命运呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "你是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "挡路了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "是这里……熟悉的地方……跟梦里一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "「她」真的存在……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "还有……那幅画……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "这一切……都是……真的……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "「禁止通行」——回答我，你是什么人？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "我见过你，在梦里的那张「合家欢」……那时候，你穿着旗袍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "？！\n你怎么会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰嗡嗡嗡，呜鲁——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嘿头儿，怎么了……喔，这是？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "摩托车？原来是你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "阿……哈啰？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "好像……完全不是什么友善的场合阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "那边的黄头发，劫走白兔子害我追了两个街区的就是你这家伙吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "呜哇……我、我想起来了，带走红兔子那道黑黑红红的身影……就、就是……！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "这么说……协助「天启」诱饵脱身的，就是你们三个？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "哼，「天启」的帮手，想必也是「天启」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈，哈……想宰人的感觉……又来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22612023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "你也是这么想的吗，那就全都杀掉吧，哈哈哈哈哈——上吧上吧上吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-487",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "blackyouji",
          "rowIds": [
            22612001,
            22612002,
