      "title": "异乡归人·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22615001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "你们也来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "源上",
          "text": "有这种大反攻的机会，怎么能不凑一凑热闹呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "就是说阿，我早就看那帮家伙不爽了，\n「天启」，哼哼，有什么了不起？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "喝哈哈哈哈哈——痛快！好久没这么痛快了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "嘿嘿嘿嘿，把他们全都杀，光，光——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "这个地方我熟，前面就是他们的据点了，三班守卫，每班九位，现在正是守备森严的时候。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "正合我意，今晚，战个痛快！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "有光，是巡逻卫队。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "诸位小心行事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "克里斯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "没错，是我，我又回来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "想不到吧，昨天你对我爱答不理，今天就让你跪地不起！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22615013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "看球——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "……咕？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "警报！敌袭！警报！敌袭！\n嗷——嗷——嗷喔喔——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "呜哇……糟、糟糕，被发现啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "嗷——嗷——嗷喔喔——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "真难听，闭嘴吧你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22616006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "你们……呃……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
