      ],
      "title": "异乡归人·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22617001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……不甘心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "一斩，瞬——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不要，和江……不要再试了，没用的……你已经受伤了，再这样下去……真的会死掉的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不能让他们把你带走……咳咳……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "嗯，优纪前辈，和江前辈……花迦也……不会放弃的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "花迦会……抱上一切觉悟……\n……因为这就是我所坚守的，一切！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "不自量力的东西，哼哼哼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "刷拉——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不要阿——花迦——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "唔呃……咳咳咳……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "只……只是做了自己应该做的，能够帮上大家的忙就好了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江也好，花迦也好，大家都是大笨蛋！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "放过他们！放过他们！\n你们要抓的人是我，带我去见他！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "像这样早点乖乖投降多好，自讨苦吃的蠢材。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "走吧，说不定阿撒兹勒大人宽宏大量，还能放你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰隆——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "稀里哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "嗷——嗷——嗷喔喔——！！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "什么声……呃！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "你们安全了，这里交给我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你……你是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "（好快的身手，好帅气的女孩子……她的身上，为什么有一股……熟悉的味道？）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "不要恋战，去找梅根，她会在外面接应你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "再见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……请，请等一下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617026",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "（为什么那样看着我……糟糕……不由自主就喊住她了……）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对不起……谢谢……请、请问……我们是不是……在哪见过？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "像小说里的冷酷侠女，头也不回地走掉了呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是啊……不知道为什么……有一种奇怪的感觉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "咳，咳咳……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "阿和江，你怎么样，身体痛不痛……还能站得住吗，要不要靠在我身上？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22617033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "这里很不安全……我们还是按照她说的，尽快去找梅根汇合吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
